 body+=section('How to assess customer reviews without mixing services','Read the original platform and confirm the exact business identity, date and purchased product. A comment about a free webinar does not establish the quality of tax preparation; a return-preparation testimonial does not establish a course’s value. Look for specific delivery facts and the provider’s response rather than relying only on a star average.','Check several recent and older accounts and ask the firm for relevant references. AE has not aggregated ratings, verified reviewer identities or adjudicated complaints. Testimonials and public savings claims are not a forecast for your circumstances.')
